algorithms.pseudocode:
function LAYERED_DISCOVERY(G, S, rounds):
    disc = S
    for i = 1 to rounds:
        layer = {v in V \ disc : forall u in pred(v), u in disc}
        disc = disc union layer
    return disc

Time: O(rounds * (|V| + |E|))

function CRITICAL_PATH(G, v):
    if pred(v) = empty: return [v]
    u* = argmax{DEPTH(G, u) : u in pred(v)}
    return CRITICAL_PATH(G, u*) ++ [v]

Time: O(|V| + |E|)
